          "short": "$\\triangle ABC$ is similar to $\\triangle AMB$, which is similar to $\\triangle BMC$ (AAA).",
          "worked": "The matching angles, in vertex order, are $25^\\circ$, $90^\\circ$ and $65^\\circ$ in each triangle. Therefore $\\triangle ABC\\sim\\triangle AMB\\sim\\triangle BMC$ (AAA).",
