                      "type": "math",
                      "latex": "\\frac{a}{b}=\\frac{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{5mm}\\hspace{8mm}}}{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{5mm}\\hspace{8mm}}}=\\frac{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{5mm}\\hspace{8mm}}}{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{5mm}\\hspace{8mm}}}",
